      "description": "This is a photorealistic 3D model of a human skull crafted entirely from flawless, mirror-polished chrome. The surface is perfectly smooth with no scratches, pores, imperfections, or material variation. Every part of the skull\u2014cranium, jaw, and teeth\u2014reflects the surrounding studio environment with extreme clarity, creating the impression of a liquid metal sculpture.\n\nThe chrome behaves like a pure reflective shader: bright studio lights appear as stretched white highlights across the forehead and cheekbones, while darker areas of the environment form deep black reflections. Convex surfaces distort reflections outward, while concave areas such as the eye sockets create complex multi-bounce reflections that enhance depth. The teeth merge into a single continuous metallic structure, defined only by sharp, dark reflection lines between them.",
